---
import NewsletterForm from './NewsletterForm.astro';
import { getListing } from '../lib/content';

const listing = await getListing();
---

<aside class="sidebar" aria-label="About Muscle Hacking">
  <p>Want to stay up to date with my writing?</p>
  <p>Enter your email below and I’ll send you my latest articles.</p>
  <p>(and other subscriber-only content).</p>
  <NewsletterForm formId="sidebar" campaign="sidebar" buttonText="Email Me" placement="sidebar" hideLabel />
  <p><em>No Junk. Unsubscribe at any time.</em></p>
  <h2>About</h2>
  <p class="sidebar-about">
    After finding an apple labelled “<em>Gluten-free</em>” at my local supermarket, I finally snapped.
    <br /><br />
    There are <strong><em>a lot</em></strong> of lies and truth twisting in the health and fitness industry.
    <br /><br />
    This blog is my attempt to cut through the BS.
    <br /><br />
    A genuine evidence-based approach to fitness and nutrition.
    <br /><br />
    To start with—you need to know how much food to eat (hint: it’s not “<em>as much as you can possibly stuff your face with</em>”).
    <br /><br />
    Use this <a href="/calorie-calculator/">calorie and macro calculator</a> to figure that out for you.
    <br /><br />
    Have a question? You can reach out to me at <a href="mailto:jay@musclehacking.com">jay@musclehacking.com</a>.
    <br /><br />
    I’m here to help. To guide you as best I can through all the misinformation and “magic pills”.
    <br /><br />
    But *you* are the one that needs to actually *do it*.
    <br /><br />
    Remember: <strong>no one is coming to save you</strong>.
    <br /><br />
    Learn to save yourself.
  </p>
  <section class="sidebar-recent" aria-labelledby="recent-posts-heading">
    <h2 id="recent-posts-heading">Recent Posts</h2>
    <ul>
      {listing.map((entry) => <li><a href={entry.href}>{entry.sidebarTitle}</a></li>)}
    </ul>
  </section>
</aside>
